# Build output. `/target` rather than `target` so a crate that ever legitimately
# holds a directory of that name deeper in the tree is not swallowed too.
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Binaries and object files that land outside `target`: a `cc` invocation with
# no `-o`, a kernel image built by hand, a core dump from a crash.
a.out
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
core

# Frames the simulator and the tests dump with `--ppm`. Never an asset: the
# images a scene actually ships are `.qoi` and `.gif`, and those are tracked.
*.ppm

# The tooling this happens to be written with. None of it describes the
# toolkit, all of it changes every session, and a repository is better for
# not carrying somebody else's editor state.
.claude/
.claude-flow/
CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json
/memory/
/coordination/
.swarm/
.hive-mind/
.roo/
.roomodes

# The house rules the code is written to: kept out of the published tree on
# purpose, so anyone reading the repository is reading the toolkit.
instructions.md
